a while. I only play speed monks. Kind of annoyed with myself cause I
could have easily tightened it up a bit and beaten the elusive (for
me) 10k mark. For example, once I found the wand of wishing in sokoban
I could have just wished for the amulet instead of finishing the
level. That would have shaved probably 200 right there. But it's still
my fastest ascension so far.

